# ── mForce standard build-context exclusions ──────────────────────────────
# Added 2026.09.14. Editing backups must never enter an image: 434 of them sat inside
# the build contexts, many under public/ or web/, so previous versions of pages were
# being served to anyone who guessed the filename. Local installs must not either —
# they are rebuilt in the image, and a darwin-arm64 binary would shadow the linux/amd64
# one that npm ci installs.
*.pre_*
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.orig
*.rej
*.guardtmp
*~
**/_to_delete/
**/_archive/
**/_superseded/
**/node_modules
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.*
# ── end mForce standard exclusions ────────────────────────────────────────
